      "description": "This dataset curates and distributes, in an AWS-friendly manner, only those publicly available datasets registered on the Geospatial Information Center (front.geospatial.jp) that explicitly specify a Creative Commons (CC) license. The collection includes a wide range of geospatial data types useful for analysis and application development, such as 3D city/building models (e.g., CityGML), elevation and terrain data (e.g., DEM), vector datasets for administrative boundaries, land use, and facilities, and disaster-related geospatial data (e.g., hazard information and damage scenarios).",
